msgid ""
"Consider supporting us by becoming a <span class=\"font-bold text-text-"
"l\">GitHub Sponsor</span> to cover ongoing development and operational costs."
msgstr ""
"Поддержите нас, став <span class=\"font-bold text-text-l\">спонсором на "
